CeladonCity_Gym_Text_ErikaIntro::
    .string "Welcome to the CELADON GYM.\p"
    .string "My name is NORMAN.\n"
    .string "I am the LEADER here.\p"
    .string "I have dedicated my life to the\n"
    .string "pursuit of true power through\l"
    .string "discipline and balance.\p"
    .string "My POKéMON are of the NORMAL type.\n"
    .string "Do not let the name fool you.\l"
    .string "We rely on pure, unadulterated might.\p"
    .string "If you wish to challenge me,\n"
    .string "I will show you the results of\l"
    .string "our rigorous training.\p"
    .string "Come! Show me what you've got!{PLAY_BGM MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_ErikaDefeat::
    .string "…I see.\n"
    .string "I was wrong to underestimate you.\p"
    .string "You possess a strong spirit and\n"
    .string "excellent technique.\p"
    .string "I confer on you the\n"
    .string "BALANCEBADGE.$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_ErikaPostBattle::
    .string "You are collecting BADGES?\n"
    .string "I must say I'm impressed.\p"
    .string "A true TRAINER never stops seeking\n"
    .string "self-improvement.$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_ExplainRainbowBadgeTakeThis::
    .string "The BALANCEBADGE will make\n"
    .string "POKéMON up to Lv. 50 obey.\p"
    .string "It also allows POKéMON to use\n"
    .string "STRENGTH in and out of battle.\p"
    .string "Please also take this with you.$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedTM19FromErika::
    .string "{PLAYER} received TM42\n"
    .string "from NORMAN.$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_ExplainTM19::
    .string "TM42 contains FACADE.\p"
    .string "It doubles in power if your\n"
    .string "POKéMON is poisoned, burned,\l"
    .string "or paralyzed.\p"
    .string "It turns a disadvantage into\n"
    .string "overwhelming strength.$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_ShouldMakeRoomForThis::
    .string "You should make room for this.$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_KayIntro::
    .string "I should warn you about this GYM.\p"
    .string "We don't rely on cheap tricks.\n"
    .string "Only raw power!$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_KayDefeat::
    .string "Overpowered!$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_KayPostBattle::
    .string "Ugh!\n"
    .string "I need to hit the weights again!$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_BridgetIntro::
    .string "Oh, a challenger.\n"
    .string "I hope you can take a hit.$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_BridgetDefeat::
    .string "My defense broke!$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_BridgetPostBattle::
    .string "NORMAL-type POKéMON have very few\n"
    .string "weaknesses.\p"
    .string "You have to strike them with pure\n"
    .string "FIGHTING spirit.$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_TinaIntro::
    .string "…Are you prepared for a relentless\n"
    .string "physical assault?$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_TinaDefeat::
    .string "You struck harder!$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_TinaPostBattle::
    .string "NORMAN's training regimen is brutal.\n"
    .string "You won't survive him.$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_TamiaIntro::
    .string "Look at the sheer muscle of\n"
    .string "my POKéMON!\p"
    .string "We crush everything in our path!$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_TamiaDefeat::
    .string "Crushed!$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_TamiaPostBattle::
    .string "We only use NORMAL-type POKéMON at\n"
    .string "our GYM.\p"
    .string "Why? Because we don't need type\n"
    .string "advantages to win!$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_LisaIntro::
    .string "Hey! We train day and night\n"
    .string "to master the basics!$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_LisaDefeat::
    .string "My basics weren't enough!$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_LisaPostBattle::
    .string "Our LEADER NORMAN might be strict,\n"
    .string "but he brings out our true potential.$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_LoriIntro::
    .string "Pleased to meet you.\n"
    .string "Let's see your combat fundamentals.$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_LoriDefeat::
    .string "Oh!\n"
    .string "Flawless execution!$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_LoriPostBattle::
    .string "A solid foundation is the key to\n"
    .string "any victory. You have it.$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_MaryIntro::
    .string "Welcome to CELADON GYM!\p"
    .string "You'd better not underestimate\n"
    .string "our physical conditioning.$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_MaryDefeat::
    .string "Outmatched!$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_MaryPostBattle::
    .string "I didn't train hard enough.\n"
    .string "NORMAN is going to make me run laps.$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue::
    .string "CELADON POKéMON GYM\n"
    .string "LEADER: NORMAN\p"
    .string "WINNING TRAINERS:\n"
    .string "{RIVAL}$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_GymStatuePlayerWon::
    .string "CELADON POKéMON GYM\n"
    .string "LEADER: NORMAN\p"
    .string "WINNING TRAINERS:\n"
    .string "{RIVAL}, {PLAYER}$"

